**题干**：写出下列程序的运行结果，并给出逐行执行过程与变量追踪表。

```java
public class Read3 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int x = 1;
        switch (x) {
            case 1:
                System.out.print("A");
            case 2:
                System.out.print("B");
                break;
            case 3:
                System.out.print("C");
                break;
            default:
                System.out.print("D");
        }
        System.out.println();
    }
}
